{"v":4,"desc":"回到那Ni no Kuni: Wrath of the White Witch另一個世界的旅程。LEVEL-5的經典傳奇以盡善盡美之姿登上Nintendo Switch，更進化的圖像及表現。為了從一場悲劇之後找回母親，加入Oliver在這充滿兇險敵人的世界並結交新夥伴來展開冒險旅程。\n\n此次充滿魅力的作品，是由聲名遠播動畫製作團隊吉卜力工作室以及著名作曲家久石讓的音樂創作相互通力合作。Ni no Kuni: Wrath of the White Witch結合了華麗的畫視覺效果、精湛的敘事劇情、唯美的音樂篇章，造就了這與無倫比的史詩角色扮演冒險作品。","publisher":"BANDAI NAMCO Entertainment Asia","release":"2019-09-20","genres":["角色扮演"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 6.2GB / Switch 6.2GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ce907845ffd6c63014e0c5b72d5733fe7c514a30cea9cd15558d2dbabbbf060b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f800c4e07798720aaef9212d36c514c8110f3e62c02ebabc61b4e84ff0fd4a34.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a975f0912f5defcd429c7c381886fc8ba3a98a564c86b8c1fecbfd5a40419bf2.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/996275d2567da539fa039f3226de88ee8785f1994f39ca5bb9ae26c60477f20b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6cf994424c4f0ddf11fbde7e13faf7b918ede802f00e9f89a768604b71b13c46.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d16aae3f86410cd96a5d78d951a8467eeb68f6f9d42514ba6505c7ac7d5ea607.jpg"],"titleId":"0100e5600d446000","dlc":[]}